5238 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The first idea is a self\055service check\055up installation designed for clinic or health\055centre waiting areas\056 Visitors approach the machine and undergo a quick sensor\055based scan intended to capture basic health indicators\056 Once the scan is complete\054 the system prints a small receipt displaying the collected readings\056 The machine does not store information or provide a digital interface\073 the printed slip becomes the only record of the interaction\056 Visitors collect the receipt and carry it with them as a physical record\056 The installation turns a routine check\055up into a simple\054 tangible exchange between a person\054 a sensor network and a printer\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 5239 0 R
     /Pg 1074 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

5239 0 obj
  << /K [ 5238 0 R ]
     /P 5252 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 1074 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

