5259 0 obj
  << /ActualText (We often continue using objects long after they have lost their original condition\056 A worn toothbrush\054 a tangled charger\054 a bent key\056 These objects may no longer look new or function perfectly\054 but they can still carry personal significance\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 5260 0 R
     /Pg 1438 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
