  << /ActualText (An art caf\351 or workshop is already a place where people bring their creations\054 experiment and make things\056 KAHA\055NI becomes an extension of that creative experience\056\n\nVisitors can bring an object they have just made\054 place it in front of the machine and receive a story generated from its qualities and associations\056)
